      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this would be tremendously helpful for people who haven't been able to afford decent graphics cards. I was lucky enough to afford the bare minimum, a 1060, yet because it runs in Oculus VR, AND SteamVR, I find it much more difficult to run because SteamVR seems to hog up a lot of resources. I've opted to build a new PC, where this won't matter, but not everyone is lucky. Some people were only able to get a 1050, 1050 Ti, or a 1060, because of the price inflation.",
