      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For now, I think it's worth mentioning that any Oculus users who've had issues with/would like to stay away from SteamVR, or would like to enable the third touch controller waist tracking- should move over to OpenComposite as it provides a direct route from SteamVR apps to the Oculus SDK and is super easy to install. Effectively, for all intents and purposes, OpenComposite will make the VRChat Steam client into an Oculus one without the added strain on the VRC team of having to support an extra VR SDK at this point in time. \n\nYou can find OpenComposite here:\nhttps://gitlab.com/znixian/OpenOVR/blob/master/README.md",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
